<title>USA: Hahn Automotive stake held by JSC Inc.</title>
<headline>Hahn Automotive stake held by JSC Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>JSC Inc, a unit of JSC Enterprises Inc, said Tuesday it holds a 6.11 percent stake in Hahn Automotive Warehouse Inc or 281,216 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, JSC said it bought the stake on Nov 27 for $8 per share.</p>
<p>JSC acquired the stake in the Rochester, N.Y., company for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
</text>
